@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Variant 13 — Secure Electronic Ticket Registry

actor "Passenger / User" as User
actor "Operator" as Operator
actor "Auditor" as Auditor
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "Application layer" {
  component "Web / Mobile dApp" as DApp
  component "Wallet / MetaMask" as Wallet
}

rectangle "Ethereum / Sepolia" {
  component "RPC / Ethereum node" as RPC
  component "TicketSecurityRegistry\n(Solidity)" as Contract
  component "Event logs" as Logs
}

database "Protected off-chain storage\n(ticket document / personal data)" as Offchain
component "Monitoring / Block Explorer" as Monitor

User --> DApp : check ticket status
Operator --> DApp : register / validate / revoke
Auditor --> DApp : audit
Admin --> DApp : manage roles
DApp --> Wallet : request signature for WRITE
Wallet --> RPC : signed transaction
DApp --> RPC : eth_call for READ
RPC --> Contract : execute EVM call
Contract --> Logs : TicketRegistered / StatusChanged
DApp --> Offchain : store sensitive record
DApp --> Contract : store only dataHash + minimal metadata
Monitor --> RPC : read blocks / receipts / logs
Auditor --> Monitor : independent verification

note bottom of Offchain
Sensitive / personal data stays off-chain.
Only a cryptographic hash is committed on-chain.
end note

note bottom of Contract
OPERATOR_ROLE changes ticket state.
AUDITOR_ROLE accesses audit function.
DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE manages roles.
Revoked is a terminal state.
end note
@enduml
